vault-level authorization may reject arbitrary third-party owners absent 
allowance, but it does not prevent redirecting assets owned by the Account to an
arbitrary receiver. Therefore, the validation boundary is insufficient and the 
hypothesis is exploitable wherever this controller governs Account execution.
  ✓ CONFIRMED: Uniswap V3 swap recipient is not constrained to the managed 
    Justification: Upon reviewing UniV3Controller.canCall and all supported 
